Maintainer: Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: hd-fonts
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian menu
 A menu in the manner of wofi for the HyprDebian desktop. It reads a menu as
 JSON from stdin: a banner, the options with optional values, PNG or SVG
 icons and a default, and an optional size. It shows the menu in the middle
 of the screen in the hd-theme of /etc/hyprdebian/config.json and prints the
 value of the option chosen on stdout.
 .
 It draws on a wlr-layer-shell surface, as on Hyprland, and only one menu is
 open at a time.
